      "start_seconds": 0.94,
      "end_seconds": 4.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started. How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.73,
      "end_seconds": 13.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.88,
      "text": "Erm, it's a new headache at the temple. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.68,
      "end_seconds": 19.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.21,
      "end_seconds": 41.49,
      "duration_seconds": 20.28,
      "text": "I'd give it a eight, out of ten. Touching definitely sets it off. I'd say every other day. Actually, I've also had blurred vision in one eye. About blurred vision in one eye, a seven out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
