      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.78,
      "end_seconds": 77.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 79, temp 36.8 degrees, blood pressure 121 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.9,
      "end_seconds": 82.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.01,
      "end_seconds": 86.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.4,
      "end_seconds": 91.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.72,
      "end_seconds": 93.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.52,
      "end_seconds": 113.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "The temporal artery is hard, tender and has no pulse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.88,
      "end_seconds": 118.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.94,
      "end_seconds": 134.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Have you had shoulder stiffness, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.27,
      "end_seconds": 139.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no shoulder stiffness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.23,
      "end_seconds": 148.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Alright, a few quick ones: fever or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.15,
      "end_seconds": 152.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.84,
      "end_seconds": 155.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.97,
      "end_seconds": 159.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.76,
      "end_seconds": 163.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.0,
      "end_seconds": 167.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.25,
      "end_seconds": 173.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.33,
      "end_seconds": 179.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "It's, It's paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.0,
      "end_seconds": 181.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.57,
      "end_seconds": 199.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.37,
      "end_seconds": 208.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I've got arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.7,
      "end_seconds": 210.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Hm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.39,
      "end_seconds": 229.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.34,
      "end_seconds": 235.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "I had a varicose vein procedure last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.02,
      "end_seconds": 241.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.59,
      "end_seconds": 246.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.67,
      "end_seconds": 249.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.17,
      "end_seconds": 259.41,
      "duration_seconds": 8.24,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago. My partner and our baby. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.95,
      "end_seconds": 268.73,
      "duration_seconds": 8.78,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, it fits best with possible giant cell arteritis threatening sight. A migraine is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.24,
      "end_seconds": 273.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Uh, um, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.62,
      "end_seconds": 289.38,
      "duration_seconds": 14.76,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible giant cell arteritis threatening sight do well once it's treated properly. I'm going to order urgent blood tests, for possible giant cell arteritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 290.32,
      "end_seconds": 293.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I can book that for Tuesday at 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.13,
      "end_seconds": 297.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Mm, okay, I'll be there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.99,
      "end_seconds": 330.66,
      "duration_seconds": 31.67,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a temporal artery biopsy because of possible giant cell arteritis. The treatment will be prednisolone, 60 milligrams, once a day, until review. That's for possible giant cell arteritis. Start the steroid today, this is to protect your sight. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. I'll also refer you to the rheumatology team. One warning sign to remember: you lose vision. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.89,
      "end_seconds": 336.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Let's review you tomorrow. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.94,
      "end_seconds": 342.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
